---------------------- General Information -------------------------
%Name = "High Volume Map v3.8"
%MapFile = "HVM3.8.map"

%LevelBriefing = "This is the level briefing.//
Bigger is better.//
Keep parcels 2,3, and 4 for later. Parcels 5,6,7 for the end game.//
Train like there's no tomorrow. Books are better than old bones are better than projectors. Only the best for us!//
Got it?"
%LevelDebriefing = "Extremely good work!//Where to next?//"

Town properties
InterestRate is defined as centiprocent to allow for two decimals precision, i.e.
300 means 3 %
#town.StartCash.InterestRate 300000 1200

-------------------- Disease Configuration -------------------------

When a drug is researched, what effectiveness does it have
#gbv.StartRating 80

The following table contains all diagnoses and treatments that shows up inthe drug casebook
in the game. Known specifies whether it should show up from the beginning of the level and
RschReqd how much research is required to discover the treatment room for the disease.
